Wave: UIR-17/18/19/21 completion wave — sole engine runner; $0; no commits/staging/push.
Engine: **ran this wave** — `"/Applications/Godot.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot" --headless --path godot/ --script res://tests/ui/screen_settings_audit.gd`
